# Way of the Deathbringer empowers a Jace token to 5 as it enters. The granted "[-2]: You may sacrifice a creature. If you do, create a 4/4
# green Beast creature token with trample" is activated on the token: 5 - 2 = 3, Bot1 sacrifices its Ornithopter (the sacrifice is chosen as
# the ability resolves) and gets the Beast. Bot2's Dryad Arbor is a creature too but is not Bot1's to sacrifice ("a creature" from the
# activator's own, CR 701.21a) and stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Way of the Deathbringer
Plains
Plains
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Dryad Arbor
Island x20

